  - id: HYP-02
    promptText: "What can Paul's fingerprint on the knife tell us?"
    options:
    - id: theory-accidental-fall
      text: Paul used the knife during the attack.
    - id: theory-homicide
      text: Paul handled the knife at some point.
    - id: theory-undetermined
      text: Paul was the last person to touch the knife.
    - id: theory-knife-ownership
      text: The knife belongs to Paul.
    requiresReasoning: 1
    reasoningOptions:
