  - id: HYP-03
    promptText: "How do the findings fit together at this point?"
    options:
    - id: theory-accidental-fall
      text: Peter is responsible because the vendor saw him leave.
    - id: theory-homicide
      text: Paul is responsible because his fingerprint was found on the knife.
    - id: theory-undetermined
      text: Physical findings and any independently discovered timeline contradictions
        must be considered together before responsibility can be assigned.
    - id: theory-bottle-presence
      text: The liquor bottle establishes who remained at the scene.
    requiresReasoning: 1
    reasoningOptions:
    - id: hyp03-knife-print-implicates-brother
